{
  "id": "sm-dns-check-tutorial",
  "title": "How to Perform Real-Time DNS Monitoring in Grafana Cloud",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "In this guide, you'll set up and run a DNS check in Grafana Cloud Synthetic Monitoring, including configuration, selecting probe locations, and alerting\n\n### **Why Use DNS Checks?**\n\nDNS checks let you detect resolution failures and latency globally, catch security threats like DDoS attacks and DNS poisoning early, and validate that domains resolve correctly from multiple locations.\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open Synthetic Monitoring and choose the check type."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "navigate-synthetics",
      "title": "Navigate to Synthetic Monitoring",
      "objectives": [
        "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/testing-and-synthetics']",
          "content": "Click **Testing & synthetics** in the main menu.",
          "requirements": [
            "navmenu-open",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/testing-and-synthetics"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[id='pageContent'] a[href='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home']",
          "content": "Click **Open** on the **Synthetics** card.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/testing-and-synthetics",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='app-init init-button']",
          "content": "If prompted, click **Get started**.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[data-testid='action create check']",
          "content": "Click **Create new check** to get started.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/home",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/choose-type"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[href='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint']",
          "content": "Select **API Endpoint** as the check type. This is where you'll find HTTP, Ping, DNS, TCP, and Traceroute checks.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/choose-type",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You opened the editor for an API endpoint check.\n\nNow let's configure the DNS check. You'll give it a name, set the request type to DNS, and specify the domain you want to monitor."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "configure-dns-check",
      "title": "Configure the DNS Check",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "input[data-testid='checkEditor form job']",
          "targetvalue": "Example:DNS",
          "content": "Enter a **Job Name** for your check, for example **Example:DNS**.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "label:contains('DNS')",
          "content": "Set the **Request Type** to **DNS**.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[name=\"target\"]",
          "content": "Enter your **Request Target** — the domain name to resolve, for example **grafana.com**.",
          "targetvalue": "grafana.com",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "In this section you can set the expected DNS response code, configure a timeout, and add labels to organize your check. These help ensure the check accurately detects failures."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "optional-parameters",
      "title": "Configure Optional Parameters",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation uptime']",
          "content": "Click **Uptime** to move to the next configuration section.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "noop",
          "content": "Optionally set the **Valid Response Code**. We will keep **NOERROR** to confirm the DNS query returned a valid response. The check will fail if any other response code is returned."
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "[aria-label=\"timeout seconds input\"]",
          "content": "Optionally set a **Timeout**. If the check takes longer than this to run it will be marked as failed. A value of **10 seconds** is suitable for most DNS checks.",
          "targetvalue": "10",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation labels']",
          "content": "Move to the **Labels** section.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Optionally add **Labels** to help organize and filter your checks.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[placeholder='name']",
              "targetvalue": "env"
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "input[placeholder='value']",
              "targetvalue": "test"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Probes are monitoring agents distributed around the world that send DNS queries to your target. Selecting multiple locations validates that your domain resolves correctly across different regions."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "configure-execution",
      "title": "Select Probe Locations and Frequency",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation execution']",
          "content": "Click **Execution** to move to the probe configuration section.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "label[data-testid='checkEditor form probeLabel']:first-of-type",
          "content": "Select one or more **Probe Locations** to run the DNS check from. Choose locations closest to your users or infrastructure to best reflect their experience.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "input[data-testid='data-testid radio-button-option 60000']",
          "content": "Optionally adjust the **Probe Frequency**. The default of 1 minute is suitable for most checks.",
          "skippable": true,
          "doIt": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Alerting ensures you're notified as soon as DNS resolution starts failing. Set a threshold that reflects your tolerance for missed resolutions."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "configure-alerting",
      "title": "Configure Alerting",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor navigation alerting']",
          "content": "Click **Alerting** to move to the alerting configuration section.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "label:has(input[data-testid='checkEditor alerts ProbeFailedExecutionsTooHigh selectedCheckbox'])",
          "content": "Enable the **Probe Failed Executions** alert by clicking the checkbox.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "targetstate": "true",
          "reftarget": "label:has(input[data-testid='checkEditor alerts ProbeFailedExecutionsTooHigh selectedCheckbox']:checked)",
          "content": "**Probe Failed Executions** is enabled.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "verify": "exists-reftarget"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor feat-adhoc-check testButton']",
          "content": "Optionally click **Test** to validate the DNS check before saving.",
          "skippable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='checkEditor form submit']",
          "content": "Click **Save** to create your DNS check. Grafana Cloud will begin executing it immediately.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/new/api-endpoint",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "id": "check-created",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[href^='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/'][href$='/edit']",
          "content": "Your check is saved. Use **Edit check** to update its configuration.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/",
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "verify": "exists-reftarget"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Congratulations!\n\nYou've successfully set up a DNS check in Grafana Cloud Synthetic Monitoring. You can now:\n\n- View results in the out-of-the-box **Synthetic Monitoring dashboard**, showing uptime, reachability, average latency, and frequency\n- Monitor **response latency and resource records by probe location** for deeper visibility into global DNS performance\n- Receive **alerts** the moment DNS resolution fails or returns unexpected results\n\nTo learn more, visit the documentation to explore other check types such as HTTP, Ping, and TCP checks."
    }
  ]
}
